{
  "category": "Teamwork Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "They form groups of roughly 20 individuals. Their mutual bond is remarkable—they will never let down a comrade.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "They battle with hard berries for weapons. Their techniques are passed from the boss to the group, generation upon generation.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "They use their saliva to stick leaves to their shoulders. You can tell what troop they belong to from the position of the leaves.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Berries are its weapons as well as the staple of its diet. The one that can throw a berry the farthest is the boss of the troop.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Displaying amazing teamwork, they follow the orders of their boss as they all help out in the search for their favorite berries.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passimian live in groups of about 20, with each member performing an assigned role. Through cooperation, the group survives.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
